`]}),e.jsxs(r,{title:"Two softmax changes for a GPU whose matrix units outgrew the rest",children:[e.jsxs(s.p,{children:["From Hopper to Blackwell, Tensor Core throughput doubled while other units grew more slowly or not at all ",e.jsx(i,{id:"zadouri2026flashattention4",children:"Zadouri et al., 2026"}),". Per SM and clock, the B200 performs 8,192 bf16 MMA operations against Hopper's 4,096. Its special-function unit still computes 16 exponentials, and its shared memory still delivers 128 bytes, as on Hopper. The matrix products of attention got faster and the exponentials did not, so the exponentials take a larger share of the time."]}),e.jsxs(s.p,{children:["FlashAttention-4 changes the softmax in two ways. First, it computes ",e.jsx(s.code,{children:"2^x"})," in software on the fused multiply-add (FMA) units for 10 to 25% of the entries in each row. A range reduction and a polynomial of degree 3 match the hardware result to within one bf16 unit in the last place. The FMA units and the special-function unit then work in parallel."]}),e.jsxs(s.p,{children:["Second, it rescales only when the maximum grows by more than a threshold ",e.jsx(s.code,{children:"τ"}),", typically ",e.jsx(s.code,{children:"log₂ 256 = 8"}),". The threshold is in base-2 units, because FlashAttention-4, like our kernel, evaluates the exponential as ",e.jsx(s.code,{children:"2^x"}),". A stale maximum lets exponentials reach at most 256, which fp32 holds easily. Because ",e.jsx(s.code,{children:"l"})," and ",e.jsx(s.code,{children:"o"})," use the same stale maximum, it cancels in ",e.jsx(s.code,{children:"o / l"}),". To avoid divergence, all lanes of a warp rescale together when any one needs it ",e.jsx(i,{id:"zadouri2026flashattention4",children:"Zadouri et al., 2026"}),"."]})]})]}),e.jsxs(t,{title:"Read production kernels by their roles",accent:5,number:"30",items:"3",children:[e.jsxs(s.ul,{children:[`
